# [[character]], [[nature]], [[characteristic]]s of a person
#: {{syn|fi|luonne}}
#: {{coi|fi|[[käydä]] {{fi-vp-joku|genitive}} '''luonnolle'''|q+ first infinitive|to be (very) hard for someone (to do something); to pain someone greatly (to do something)}}
